# Format: <name> <platform> <version> <url> <sha512-base64>
# Platforms: darwin-arm64 | darwin-x64 | linux-x64 | linux-arm64
# setup.sh installs only the lines matching the machine it runs on.
#
# Updating: bump version + URLs for ALL platforms and re-pin each
# hash as one reviewable commit:
#   esbuild — the npm registry's `dist.integrity` field
#             (curl https://registry.npmjs.org/@esbuild/<plat>/<ver>)
#   deno    — download the release zip, cross-check the upstream
#             .sha256sum asset, then
#             `openssl dgst -sha512 -binary <zip> | openssl base64 -A`
# A tarball that doesn't match is rejected; fresh checkouts MUST get
# byte-identical binaries or setup.sh refuses to install.

